{"sha": "37cf437d073477d3825949b6a936ea2408ee4e724356a878d29397e90e675cb3", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:curves:8}", "\\emph{园丁：}将长为 $2a$ 的绳子两端分别系在两根木桩 $F,", "F'$ 上，用笔尖 $M$ 将绳子拉紧：约束条件恰为", "$MF + MF' = 2a$，因此所画曲线为椭圆。", "", "\\emph{反射性质：}设 $t \\mapsto M(t)$ 为正则", "参数化，并记 $u(t) = \\frac{M(t) - F}{\\norm{M(t) - F}}$，", "$u'(t)$ 是对 $F'$ 类似定义的单位向量。对", "$\\norm{M - F} + \\norm{M - F'} = 2a$ 两边求导，并利用 $\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd", "t}\\norm{M - F} = \\bigl\\langle \\frac{M - F}{\\norm{M-F}},\\,", "M'\\bigr\\rangle$（对 $\\sqrt{\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle}$ 用链式法则）：", "\\[", "\\bigl\\langle u + u',\\, M'\\bigr\\rangle = 0 .", "\\]", "于是切方向 $M'$ 正交于两焦半径的", "平分线方向 $u + u'$：切线", "与 $MF$、$MF'$ 所成角相等。（从一个焦点发出的光线", "经椭圆反射后射向另一焦点。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:curves:9}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 定义域：$\\cos 2\\theta \\geq 0$，即 $\\theta \\in", "        \\intcc{-\\frac\\pi4}{\\frac\\pi4} \\cup", "        \\intcc{\\frac{3\\pi}{4}}{\\frac{5\\pi}{4}}$。对称性：$\\theta", "        \\mapsto -\\theta$（关于 $x$ 轴）及 $\\theta \\mapsto \\pi -", "        \\theta$（关于 $y$ 轴）：只需研究 $\\intcc{0}{\\frac\\pi4}$；$r$", "        由 $1$ 减小至 $0$。当 $\\theta = \\pm\\frac\\pi4$ 时：$r =", "        0$，原点处切线沿两条对角线方向。曲线", "        形如 $\\infty$ 符号：两个对称的环在 $O$ 处相交，", "        并经过点 $(\\pm 1, 0)$。", "  \\item 设 $F, F' = (\\pm c, 0)$，$c = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt 2}$，点 $M", "        = (r\\cos\\theta, r\\sin\\theta)$:", "        \\[", "        MF^2\\, MF'^2", "        = \\bigl((r\\cos\\theta - c)^2 + r^2\\sin^2\\theta\\bigr)", "        \\bigl((r\\cos\\theta + c)^2 + r^2\\sin^2\\theta\\bigr)", "        = (r^2 + c^2)^2 - (2rc\\cos\\theta)^2 ,", "        \\]", "        由恒等式 $(A - B)(A + B) = A^2 - B^2$，取 $A = r^2", "        + c^2$，$B = 2rc\\cos\\theta$。代入 $c^2 = \\frac12$：", "        \\[", "        MF^2 MF'^2 = \\Bigl(r^2 + \\frac12\\Bigr)^2 - 2r^2\\cos^2\\theta", "        = r^4 + r^2\\bigl(1 - 2\\cos^2\\theta\\bigr) + \\frac14", "        = r^4 - r^2\\cos 2\\theta + \\frac14 .", "        \\]", "        在双纽线 $r^2 = \\cos 2\\theta$ 上，前两项", "        相互抵消，剩下 $MF^2MF'^2 = \\frac14$，即\\ $MF \\cdot MF' =", "        \\frac12$。反过来，将上述计算逆推可知", "        轨迹方程 $MF\\,MF' = \\frac12$ 等价于 $r^2 = \\cos", "        2\\theta$（要求 $r \\neq 0$；$O$ 两式均满足）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:curves:10}", "$r = 1 + \\cos\\theta$, $r' = -\\sin\\theta$:", "\\[", "r^2 + r'^2 = 1 + 2\\cos\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta + \\sin^2\\theta", "= 2 + 2\\cos\\theta = 4\\cos^2\\frac\\theta2 ,", "\\]", "故 $\\sqrt{r^2 + r'^2} = 2\\abs{\\cos\\frac\\theta2}$，由", "关于 $x$ 轴的对称性，", "\\[", "L = \\int_0^{2\\pi} 2\\Bigl|\\cos\\frac\\theta2\\Bigr|\\,\\dd\\theta", "= 2\\int_0^{\\pi} 2\\cos\\frac\\theta2\\,\\dd\\theta", "= 2\\Bigl[4\\sin\\frac\\theta2\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi} = 8 .", "\\]", "另一个不含 $\\pi$ 的代数周长。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:curves:11}", "点 $(a\\cos t, b\\sin t)$ 满足方程：", "$\\cos^2 t + \\sin^2 t = 1$。该直线的法向量为", "$\\bigl(\\frac{\\cos t}a, \\frac{\\sin t}b\\bigr)$，它与", "速度 $(-a\\sin t, b\\cos t)$ 的内积为 $-\\sin t\\cos t +", "\\sin t\\cos t = 0$，故该直线过此点，", "且方向为切方向 --- 即它就是切线。设 $(x_0, y_0)$ 为椭圆上的", "点，记 $\\cos t = \\frac{x_0}a$，$\\sin t = \\frac{y_0}b$，", "代入得：", "\\[", "\\frac{x\\,x_0}{a^2} + \\frac{y\\,y_0}{b^2} = 1 ,", "\\]", "由椭圆方程经“拆分”得到：$x^2 \\mapsto", "x\\,x_0$ 及 $y^2 \\mapsto y\\,y_0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:curves:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $r' = k\\eu^{k\\theta}$，故 $\\tan V = \\frac{r}{r'} =", "        \\frac1k$，为常数。该螺线与从原点出发的每条射线", "        相交于同一夹角 $V = \\arctan\\frac1k$。", "  \\item 用复数记号，螺线为 $\\{\\eu^{k\\theta}", "        \\eu^{\\iu\\theta} : \\theta \\in \\R\\}$。旋转 $c$", "        相当于乘以 $\\eu^{\\iu c}$：", "        \\[", "        \\eu^{k\\theta}\\eu^{\\iu(\\theta + c)}", "        = \\eu^{-kc}\\,\\eu^{k(\\theta + c)}\\eu^{\\iu(\\theta+c)} ,", "        \\]", "        当 $\\theta + c$ 取遍 $\\R$ 时，这描述的是", "        $\\eu^{-kc}$ 倍的螺线：旋转 $=$ 伸缩。", "        除直线与圆外，没有其他光滑曲线", "        具有此性质。", "  \\item $\\sqrt{r^2 + r'^2} = \\sqrt{1 + k^2}\\,\\eu^{k\\theta}$，故", "        在 $\\intcc{A}{\\theta_0}$ 上的弧长为", "        $\\frac{\\sqrt{1+k^2}}{k}\\bigl(\\eu^{k\\theta_0} -", "        \\eu^{kA}\\bigr)$，当 $A \\to -\\infty$ 时：", "        \\[", "        L = \\frac{\\sqrt{1 + k^2}}{k}\\,\\eu^{k\\theta_0} < \\infty :", "        \\]", "        绕原点有无穷多圈，总长却有限", "        （各圈按几何级数递减）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", ""]}